<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφᾰκ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be unripe,</i> prop. of grapes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				5.43.3
			</span></i>, al. ; of olives, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.13.5
			</span></i> ; of other fruits, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.159
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.33
			</span></i> ; of oil, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.46
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a vine,
				<i>bear sour grapes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				18.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σικελὸς ὀμφακίζεται</span>
			the Sicilian <i>steals sour grapes,</i> prov. of one who will
			steal anything however worthless, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				239
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				2.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
